# No unit tests

Never run unit tests in this repo in any chat or session.

Do not execute commands such as `npx tsx --test`, `npm test`, `npm run test`, `node --test`, Vitest, Jest, or similar unit-test runners.

Do not suggest running unit tests as a follow-up. Integration tests and other non-unit validation are also out of scope unless the user explicitly asks for them.
